Cell["\<\
The optional upper interlayer and reverse interface couplings support \
energy-dependent nonorthogonal transformations.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->664554344,ExpressionUUID->"c0815775-50e4-5749-9671-56f041680e0e"],

